  explanation="Argument order is the SRFI-13 order and it surprises people: the SHORT string comes first. (string-prefix? \"he\" \"hello\") reads as 'is he a prefix of hello', and is #t. The empty string is a prefix of everything, and every string is a prefix of itself. This is the verb behind command dispatch, route matching, and autocomplete.",
